{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.nichika.noentry",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她在地板上练步子",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.nichika.noentry",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.nichika.noentry",
    "idolId": "nichika",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──踏步、踏步、踏步……啊──……",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……？啊，不对……反过来了──",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──踏步、踏步、踏步……啊──！",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──────踏步、踏步………………啊────不对不对…………",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "…………──────好吵。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "踏步、踏步、踏──────",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "────────………………",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……那个。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "────那个！",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………嗯？哎，你叫我了吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "哇……这绝对是叫了的情况吧！？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……对、对不起……！怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "那个，就是觉得好吵。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "我现在超级集中，能安静一点吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好、好的……吵到你了吗，我会注意的。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "拜托了──。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。到处走来走去是我不对。我轻一点────",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "────────！",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "对、对不起……莫名其妙就紧张起来了────",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──────…………にちか？",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "怎、怎么了……",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………包……还有伞……",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "椅子……",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "书……笔袋……矿泉水瓶……",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "那个──从包那里开始…………到矿泉水瓶那里────",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "请当作禁止进入区域！",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……！好……好的…………",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………啊，等等！",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "趁现在，我想喝点什么……只进厨房，可以吗……？",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "不是有自动贩卖机吗──",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那个，嗯……不是，其实我中午也没吃，冰箱里有──",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那个……蘸面。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……哈啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦哦，谢谢にちか！还有，那个────",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "饮料吗？",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "……不，不用勉强。",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "嗯……",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          },
          {
            "label": "……抱歉。",
            "nextNodeId": "140"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "哇，不勉强的话不说也可以啊──！",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "糟了，显得我超级像坏人……！",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不是，对不起！是我太吵了，我出去……！",
        "nextNodeId": "103"
      },
      "103": {
        "id": "103",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……啊………………",
        "nextNodeId": "104"
      },
      "104": {
        "id": "104",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……要拿哪个。",
        "nextNodeId": "105"
      },
      "105": {
        "id": "105",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "106"
      },
      "106": {
        "id": "106",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "要拿哪个！水、茶、咖啡！",
        "nextNodeId": "107"
      },
      "107": {
        "id": "107",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "可、可以吗……！",
        "nextNodeId": "108"
      },
      "108": {
        "id": "108",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "啊──嗯────！！超级吵的，我只拿饮料──！！"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……那个，蘸面挺辣的，吃完出去可能也吵────",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "在意吵不吵的话一开始就注意啊──借口别────哇",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──────……",
        "nextNodeId": "123"
      },
      "123": {
        "id": "123",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "现在能不能请您安静一下啊啊啊啊！！",
        "nextNodeId": "124"
      },
      "124": {
        "id": "124",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "125"
      },
      "125": {
        "id": "125",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "对、对不起……谢谢，にちか……！",
        "nextNodeId": "126"
      },
      "126": {
        "id": "126",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "127"
      },
      "127": {
        "id": "127",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那个……要吃吗，にちか也？"
      },
      "140": {
        "id": "140",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "道歉的意义我不懂，不过──好。",
        "nextNodeId": "141"
      },
      "141": {
        "id": "141",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯……果然，饮料不用了。",
        "nextNodeId": "142"
      },
      "142": {
        "id": "142",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "にちか也是，中午没吃就在拼吧……！",
        "nextNodeId": "143"
      },
      "143": {
        "id": "143",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "144"
      },
      "144": {
        "id": "144",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "30 秒──",
        "nextNodeId": "145"
      },
      "145": {
        "id": "145",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………にちか？",
        "nextNodeId": "146"
      },
      "146": {
        "id": "146",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "真的只有 30 秒，没问题吗，结界要开了……25、24、23────",
        "nextNodeId": "147"
      },
      "147": {
        "id": "147",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────哦哦！谢谢，我快点────",
        "nextNodeId": "148"
      },
      "148": {
        "id": "148",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "啊────！绝对不要碰到放着的那些东西──！！碰了会很不妙的！！！",
        "nextNodeId": "149"
      },
      "149": {
        "id": "149",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……好、好的！很不妙是指…………？",
        "nextNodeId": "150"
      },
      "150": {
        "id": "150",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……大概会挨揍吧…………！"
      }
    }
  },
